      "text": "$-0.5$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\frac{f(x+d x)-f(x)}{d x}=f^{\\prime}(x) \\\\\r\nf(x+d x)-f(x)=f^{\\prime}(x) d x\r\n\\end{array}$\r\nNow,\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\nf^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{10 e^{10 x}}{1+e^{10 x}}-\\frac{5 \\cdot e^{5 x}}{1+e^{10 x}}=\\frac{10 e^{10 x}-5 e^{5 x}}{1+e^{10 x}} \\\\\r\n\\left(f^{\\prime}(x)\\right)_{x-0}=\\frac{5}{2} \\\\\r\n\\Delta f(x)=0.2 \\times \\frac{5}{2}=0.5\r\n\\end{array}$",
    "image": null
